OL,3,AGovernments 'asleep at the wheel' over
OL,4,Asocial care, says head of review
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd she also highlighted the fees that
OL,7,Fself-funders pay, saying they were much
OL,8,Fhigher than councils were charged for
OL,9,Fpeople entitled to state support.
